\pard\sb200\sa120\sl252\slmult1\ql\keepn\b\f0\fs22 12. AUDIT\par
\pard\sa120\sl252\slmult1\qj\b0\f0\fs22 Na z\u225?klad\u283? p\u345?im\u283?\u345?en\u233?ho p\u237?semn\u233?ho ozn\u225?men\u237? (nejv\u253?\u353?e jednou ro\u269?n\u283?, s v\u253?jimkou p\u345?\u237?pad\u367?, kdy m\u225? QENEX d\u367?vodn\u233? podez\u345?en\u237? na poru\u353?en\u237?) poskytnete spole\u269?nosti QENEX informace p\u345?im\u283?\u345?en\u283? pot\u345?ebn\u233? k ov\u283?\u345?en\u237? dodr\u382?ov\u225?n\u237? t\u233?to Smlouvy, zejm\u233?na po\u269?et instalac\u237?, po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?\u367? a Produkt\u367? Z\u225?kazn\u237?ka, a umo\u382?n\u237?te spole\u269?nosti QENEX nebo nez\u225?visl\u233?mu auditorovi v\u225?zan\u233?mu ml\u269?enlivost\u237? tyto informace ov\u283?\u345?it. Prok\u225?\u382?e-li ov\u283?\u345?en\u237? u\u382?it\u237? Softwaru nad r\u225?mec z\u237?skan\u233? licence, neprodlen\u283? uhrad\u237?te licen\u269?n\u237? poplatky odpov\u237?daj\u237?c\u237? takov\u233?mu u\u382?it\u237? a nahrad\u237?te QENEX p\u345?im\u283?\u345?en\u233? n\u225?klady ov\u283?\u345?en\u237?.\par
\pard\sb200\sa120\sl252\slmult1\ql\keepn\b\f0\fs22 13. V\u221?VOZ A SOULAD S P\u344?EDPISY\par
